4.4,4,3.8,3.5,3.2,2.9,2.6,2.2],"g1":5.4,"g2":3.5,"g":2.25,"wacc":6.8,"ev":16530.5,"fmp_official_ev":16530.5,"dcf_model_ev":23620.5,"ev_to_ebitda":13.8,"debt_to_ebitda":4.3,"net_debt_to_ebitda":4.23,"f_score":6,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 3.7%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $926M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 43.2%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.61"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":51.66,"default_fair_val":51.66,"premium_pct":-38.2,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":24,"pe_forward":21.1,"pb_trailing":1.7,"pb_forward":1.5,"div_yield":4.16,"ps_ratio":3.1,"fcf_to_ev":5.6,"fcf_to_mcap":8.08,"liab_to_assets":43.2,"cash_to_assets":0.6,"current_ratio":1.61,"roe":7,"roa":3.7,"moat":{"ticker":"AMH","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"American Homes 4 Rent (AMH) 作為一家大型住宅房地產投資信託基金 (REIT)，其品牌定價權相對有限。雖然其品牌有一定辨識度，但租賃市場本質上仍是商品化程度較高的行業，租戶的選擇主要受價格、地點和房屋條件影響。AMH 的定價能力更多體現在其對市場租金趨勢的跟隨，而非顯著的溢價能力。與頂級消費品牌相比，其品牌壁壘較弱，競爭對手眾多，包括其他 REITs、獨立房東以及新開發的住宅項目。其商業模式依賴於高效的物業管理和持續的資本投入以維持房產價值，而非獨特的品牌溢價。","comment_en":"American Homes 4 Rent (AMH), as a large residential Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT), possesses relatively limited brand pricing power. While its brand has some recognition, the rental market is inherently a highly commoditized sector where tenant choices are primarily influenced by price, location, and property condition. AMH's pricing ability is more about following market rent trends than commanding significant premiums. Compared to top consumer brands, its brand barrier is weaker, with numerous competitors including other REITs, independent landlords, and newly developed residential projects. Its business model relies on efficient property management and continuous capital investment to maintain property value, rather than unique brand premiums."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"AMH 作為一家房地產公司，其業務模式不涉及專利或受嚴格監管的特許經營權。房地產行業的進入壁壘主要體現在資本需求、土地獲取和開發許可等方面，而非技術專利或政府授予的獨家經營權。因此，在專利和監管這一維度上，AMH 幾乎沒有任何經濟護城河。其運營受制於地方性房地產法規、土地使用規劃和建築標準，但這些並非能形成持續競爭優勢的壁壘，反而可能增加運營的複雜性和成本。","comment_en":"As a real estate company, AMH's business model does not involve patents or strictly regulated franchise rights. The barriers to entry in the real estate industry are primarily related to capital requirements, land acquisition, and development permits, rather than technological patents or government-granted exclusive operating rights. Therefore, AMH has virtually no economic moat in terms of patents and regulatory aspects. Its operations are subject to local real estate regulations, land use planning, and building standards, but these do not form barriers that create a sustainable competitive advantage and can instead increase operational complexity and costs."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"AMH 的租賃業務面臨中等的轉換成本。對於租戶而言，搬家通常涉及時間、金錢和精力上的成本，包括尋找新住所、支付押金和搬遷費用等。然而，在租賃市場相對活躍且供應充足的地區，租戶仍有較多選擇，轉換成本並非高到無法承受。AMH 的策略是通過提供良好居住體驗、便捷的社區設施和穩定的物業管理來提高客戶滿意度，從而間接增加租戶的留存率，但這並非嚴格意義上的高轉換成本壁壘。","comment_en":"AMH's rental business faces moderate switching costs. For tenants, moving typically involves costs in terms of time, money, and effort, including searching for a new residence, paying deposits, and moving expenses. However, in areas with a relatively active rental market and ample supply, tenants still have many choices, and the switching costs are not prohibitively high. AMH's strategy is to enhance customer satisfaction by providing a good living experience, convenient community amenities, and stable property management, thereby indirectly increasing tenant retention rates. However, this is not a high switching cost barrier in the strict sense."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"AMH 的業務模式不具備顯著的網絡效應。網絡效應是指一個產品或服務的價值隨著用戶數量的增加而增加。在住宅租賃領域，單一房產或單一社區的價值並不會因為入住的租戶增多而顯著提升其對新租戶的吸引力。雖然一個管理良好的大型社區可能提供一定的便利性，但這更多是規模效應而非網絡效應。AMH 的競爭優勢不依賴於用戶網絡的擴張，而是基於其物業組合的質量、地理位置和運營效率。","comment_en":"AMH's business model does not exhibit significant network effects. Network effects refer to the phenomenon where the value of a product or service increases as the number of users grows. In the residential rental sector, the value of a single property or community does not significantly increase its attractiveness to new tenants as more tenants move in. While a well-managed large community might offer some convenience, this is more of a scale effect than a network effect. AMH's competitive advantage does not rely on the expansion of a user network but rather on the quality of its property portfolio, location, and operational efficiency."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"AMH 作為美國最大的住宅租賃公司之一，其規模帶來了顯著的成本優勢。龐大的物業組合使其在採購、維護、保險和融資等方面能夠獲得更優惠的價格和條款。例如，集中採購建築材料和設備、與大型服務供應商簽訂長期合同，以及利用其信用評級獲得更低的貸款利率，這些都是規模帶來的效益。這種成本優勢使其能夠在維持競爭性租金的同時，保持健康的利潤率，並抵禦小型競爭對手的價格壓力。","comment_en":"As one of the largest residential rental companies in the United States, AMH's scale provides significant cost advantages. Its vast property portfolio allows it to obtain more favorable pricing and terms in procurement, maintenance, insurance, and financing. For instance, centralized purchasing of building materials and equipment, long-term contracts with large service providers, and leveraging its credit rating for lower loan interest rates are all benefits of scale. This cost advantage enables it to maintain healthy profit margins while offering competitive rents, and to withstand pricing pressures from smaller competitors."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"AMH 擁有廣泛的地理佈局，其房產遍布美國多個高增長地區。雖然這些資產本身並非獨一無二，但其在特定高需求區域的集中佈局，以及對這些區域市場的深入了解，構成了某種程度的地理優勢。這些地區通常具有強勁的人口增長、就業機會和租金上漲潛力。AMH 通過精選的地理位置和對當地市場動態的把握，能夠更好地滿足目標租戶群體的需求，從而獲得相對穩定的租金收入和資產增值。","comment_en":"AMH possesses a broad geographic footprint with properties spread across multiple high-growth regions in the United States. While these assets are not inherently unique, their concentrated presence in specific high-demand areas, coupled with deep knowledge of these local markets, constitutes a degree of geographic advantage. These regions typically exhibit strong population growth, employment opportunities, and potential for rent increases. By selecting prime locations and understanding local market dynamics, AMH can better meet the needs of its target tenant demographic, thereby achieving relatively stable rental income and asset appreciation."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"AMH 在運營效率方面表現出色，這得益於其對技術的應用和標準化的流程。公司利用先進的物業管理軟件來優化租賃流程、租金收取、維護請求處理和租戶溝通。其規模化的運營使得維護、修繕和租戶服務能夠以更低的單位成本進行。通過持續的流程改進和對數據的分析，AMH 能夠有效控制運營費用，提高資產的利用率和盈利能力。這種高效的運營能力是其在競爭激烈的房地產市場中保持優勢的關鍵因素之一。","comment_en":"AMH demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, attributed to its adoption of technology and standardized processes. The company utilizes advanced property management software to optimize leasing processes, rent collection, maintenance request handling, and tenant communication. Its scaled operations allow for lower per-unit costs in maintenance, repairs, and tenant services. Through continuous process improvement and data analysis, AMH effectively controls operating expenses and enhances asset utilization and profitability. This efficient operational capability is one of the key factors in maintaining its advantage in the competitive real estate market."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"AMH 的資本配置策略相對穩健，注重在擴張、維護和股息支付之間取得平衡。公司通過精準的市場分析來識別有潛力的收購目標和開發項目，同時也積極進行現有房產的升級改造以提升價值。其股息政策也相對穩定，為股東提供持續的回報。儘管 REITs 的資本配置相對透明，但 AMH 在利用債務融資和股權融資來支持增長方面表現出較好的紀律性，避免過度槓桿，並努力提高資產的回報率。","comment_en":"AMH's capital allocation strategy is relatively sound, focusing on balancing expansion, maintenance, and dividend payments. The company accurately analyzes markets to identify potential acquisition targets and development projects, while also actively undertaking upgrades and renovations of existing properties to enhance value. Its dividend policy is also relatively stable, providing consistent returns to shareholders. Although capital allocation for REITs is relatively transparent, AMH demonstrates good discipline in utilizing debt and equity financing to support growth, avoiding excessive leverage, and striving to improve asset returns."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"AMH 在客戶保留方面採取了多項措施，雖然租戶流動性是行業固有現象，但其努力通過提供高品質的居住環境和卓越的客戶服務來提高租戶滿意度和忠誠度。這包括及時的維修響應、社區活動的組織以及對租戶反饋的重視。通過維持較高的入住率和較長的平均租期，AMH 能夠穩定其收入流。然而，與某些具有強烈品牌忠誠度的消費品或服務相比，其客戶保留的壁壘仍屬中等。","comment_en":"AMH employs several measures for customer retention. Although tenant turnover is an inherent aspect of the industry, the company strives to enhance tenant satisfaction and loyalty by providing high-quality living environments and excellent customer service. This includes timely maintenance responses, organizing community events, and valuing tenant feedback. By maintaining high occupancy rates and longer average lease terms, AMH stabilizes its revenue stream. However, compared to certain consumer goods or services with strong brand loyalty, its customer retention barrier remains moderate."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"AMH 的業務模式具有較好的持久性。住宅租賃需求是基礎性的，尤其是在人口持續增長和城市化的背景下。AMH 的房產組合主要集中在美國經濟較為活躍的地區，這些地區的長期租賃需求相對穩定。儘管經濟週期會對租金水平和入住率產生影響，但其多元化的地理佈局和對不同類型租戶（如家庭、年輕專業人士）的服務能力，有助於分散風險。只要公司能持續有效地管理其資產並適應市場變化，其業務就能保持長期的韌性。","comment_en":"AMH's business model possesses good durability. The demand for residential rentals is fundamental, especially amidst continuous population growth and urbanization. AMH's property portfolio is primarily concentrated in economically active regions of the United States, where long-term rental demand is relatively stable. Although economic cycles can affect rental rates and occupancy, its diversified geographic spread and ability to serve different tenant types (e.g., families, young professionals) help mitigate risks. As long as the company can continue to effectively manage its assets and adapt to market changes, its business can maintain long-term resilience."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"AMH 的經濟護城河主要體現在其規模帶來的成本優勢（M5）和高效的運營能力（M7）。作為美國最大的住宅 REITs 之一，其龐大的資產組合使其在採購、融資和管理上具有顯著的效率。雖然其品牌定價權（M1）和客戶保留（M9）能力中等，轉換成本（M3）也非極高，但其在特定地理區域的佈局（M6）和相對穩健的資本配置（M8）提供了支撐。然而，其業務模式缺乏專利（M2）和網絡效應（M4）等強大壁壘，使其整體護城河強度屬於中等偏上水平，更像是一個高效運營的「商品型」地產商，而非擁有獨特特許經營權的企業。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"AMH's economic moat is primarily reflected in its scale-driven cost advantages (M5) and efficient operational capabilities (M7). As one of the largest residential REITs in the US, its vast property portfolio provides significant efficiencies in procurement, financing, and management. While its brand pricing power (M1) and customer retention (M9) are moderate, and switching costs (M3) are not extremely high, its strategic geographic presence (M6) and relatively sound capital allocation (M8) offer support. However, its business model lacks strong barriers such as patents (M2) and network effects (M4), placing its overall moat strength in the moderate-to-strong category. It operates more like an efficiently run 'commodity-like' real estate entity rather than a business with unique franchise characteristics.","evidenceHash":"bad9a18cc85bd0f8e83edbeb247909de173831cedd628d9c9fd1b69e2bb8e0b1","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"b11f7f1910284336e62006733e624d1b02078a022ff400e134a02fc1bf305f5a"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"b11f7f1910284336e62006733e624d1b02078a022ff400e134a02fc1bf305f5a"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/AMH.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/AMH.png","website":"https://www.amh.com","ceo":"Bryan Smith","full_time_employees":"1598","description":"American Homes 4 Rent (AMH, listed on the NYSE) holds a leading position in the single-family rental housing market. This company is rapidly establishing itself as a nationally recognized brand, highly regarded for providing rental homes that offer superior quality, excellent value, and ensure high tenant satisfaction. Operating as an internally managed Maryland Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT), AMH's core activities involve the strategic acquisition, development, refurbishment, leasing, and ongoing management of attractive single-family properties for rent. By September 30, 2020, its extensive portfolio consisted of 53,229 single-family residences, strategically located across selected submarkets in 22 U.S. states.","description_en":"American Homes 4 Rent (AMH, listed on the NYSE) holds a leading position in the single-family rental housing market. This company is rapidly establishing itself as a nationally recognized brand, highly regarded for providing rental homes that offer superior quality, excellent value, and ensure high tenant satisfaction. Operating as an internally managed Maryland Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT), AMH's core activities involve the strategic acquisition, development, refurbishment, lea